# Packages installed into the image, one per line.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# One flat list, sorted alphabetically - easier to scan and to keep tidy than
# grouped sections. Anything in the repos enabled in your base image works here.
# To check a name before adding it:  dnf info <package>
#
# Not every package the image installs is here, deliberately. Anything a later
# section of build.sh needs by name - tuned and firewalld for the units it
# enables, plymouth for the splash screen - is installed there instead, beside
# the thing that needs it. Rewriting this list is expected; losing a service
# out of the image while doing it is not, and that is what the split prevents.

